    "detailed_description": "<h1>CHECK OUT MY OTHER GAMES!</h1><p><br><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Explore, sneak, and loot procedurally generated neighborhoods in this top-down extraction shooter inspired by Project Zomboid, RimWorld, Zero Sievert, &amp; Escape From Tarkov.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hundreds of zombies in real-time!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/34d2602d63eca62dcd16337a736ace42.poster.avif?t=1741316949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/34d2602d63eca62dcd16337a736ace42.webm?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/34d2602d63eca62dcd16337a736ace42.mp4?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grid-Based Inventory System</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/3cce2420c4f536662f4a9b9730575e17.poster.avif?t=1741316949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/3cce2420c4f536662f4a9b9730575e17.webm?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/3cce2420c4f536662f4a9b9730575e17.mp4?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic LOS / Fog of war system</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/ccf16657a4b95750e66f0795cb25bde4.poster.avif?t=1741316949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/ccf16657a4b95750e66f0795cb25bde4.webm?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/ccf16657a4b95750e66f0795cb25bde4.mp4?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Procedural generation</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/19935e3c70b1cafd6db1cadc2a6aa672.poster.avif?t=1741316949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/19935e3c70b1cafd6db1cadc2a6aa672.webm?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/19935e3c70b1cafd6db1cadc2a6aa672.mp4?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i> Note: Realtime generation is shown for demonstration purposes. Procedural generation will be performed during loading. </i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building System</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/228d8f34248c5bd9cf348841a130c6a1.poster.avif?t=1741316949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/228d8f34248c5bd9cf348841a130c6a1.webm?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/228d8f34248c5bd9cf348841a130c6a1.mp4?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Colony AI</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/5c65893d19989354b05b8b97833c54e3.poster.avif?t=1741316949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/5c65893d19989354b05b8b97833c54e3.webm?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/5c65893d19989354b05b8b97833c54e3.mp4?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Follow me on YouTube for updates:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Game</h2><br>With thousands of hours in games like Project Zomboid, Escape from Tarkov, Zero Sievert, I have been inspired and working on a title for the past few years that takes the best elements I find most interesting from each title. I have been working on this project since early 2021.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The feeling of immersion and the massive amount of zombies from the Zomboid experience but also I don't want to have to commit all day to play. <br></li><li> The high-stakes inventory and gear systems from tarkov means you won't be just taking in stuff willy nilly. Whatever you do take, be prepared to lose it all<br></li><li> The Mood and health system is a mix of zomboid and rimworld. Out on the field, you will be managing your exertion, the elements, and weight capacity.<br></li><li> At home, your survivors will be working to build blueprints you've set up, cooking and managing food, taking care of the wounded, and building defenses.<br></li><li> Your colonists' moods at home mean buffs &amp; debuffs out on the field. Haven't properly eaten today? Or in a shit mood because there's nothing to do in the colony? You won't be shooting with perfect aim today</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Key Features </h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Procedural House Generation <br></li><li> Procedural Neighborhood Generation<br></li><li> Stat system - Manage Hunger, thirst, boredom, exhaustion<br></li><li> Homebase system - Build and craft homes for your colonists<br></li><li> Combat system - Melee and guns<br></li><li> Gun attachment system<br></li><li> Survivor Relationship System. Have you pissed off someone at your colony? They might steal your loot and leave.<br></li><li> Mod Support </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.poster.avif?t=1741316949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.webm?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/de0bc37a6ceeb59b56aa47c0cd6b285a.mp4?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Explore, sneak, and loot procedurally generated neighborhoods in this top-down extraction shooter inspired by Project Zomboid, RimWorld, Zero Sievert, &amp; Escape From Tarkov.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hundreds of zombies in real-time!</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/34d2602d63eca62dcd16337a736ace42.poster.avif?t=1741316949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/34d2602d63eca62dcd16337a736ace42.webm?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/34d2602d63eca62dcd16337a736ace42.mp4?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grid-Based Inventory System</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/3cce2420c4f536662f4a9b9730575e17.poster.avif?t=1741316949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/3cce2420c4f536662f4a9b9730575e17.webm?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/3cce2420c4f536662f4a9b9730575e17.mp4?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic LOS / Fog of war system</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/ccf16657a4b95750e66f0795cb25bde4.poster.avif?t=1741316949\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2360880/extras/ccf16657a4b95750e66f0795cb25bde4.webm?t=1741316949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"h